# recall_earlier_turns — Recall earlier turns

Search this conversation's turns that have left the context window, by meaning. Use when something said or done earlier is needed and is no longer in view. Each result says which turn it was and what was done in it.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** What to look for */
  query: string;
  /** Most turns to return */
  limit?: number;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://recall_earlier_turns.

